      "text": "Neural development builds a massively parallel distributed computing network. Every major phase maps onto a systems or networking concept."
    },
    {
      "id": "06-NEURAL-DEVELOPMENT.md#007",
      "path": [
        "06-NEURAL-DEVELOPMENT.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
