        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Neural Development and Brain Formation",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Axon guidance (Netrin,        Routing with attract/repel metrics:\n  Slit, Semaphorin, Ephrin)     Growth cone integrates attractive (Netrin,\n                                BDNF) and repulsive (Slit/Robo, Semaphorin)\n                                cues from the environment. Like BGP path\n                                selection: prefer paths with lower repulsion,\n                                higher attraction; each guidance molecule\n                                is a route preference metric. The final\n                                axon trajectory is the least-cost path\n                                through a gradient vector field."
    },
    {
