      "text": "```\nNEURAL INDUCTION\n─────────────────\n  The organizer (Hensen's node) secretes BMP antagonists:\n  Chordin, Noggin, Follistatin → block BMP signaling in dorsal ectoderm.\n  Low BMP → \"default neural state\" → ectoderm adopts neural fate."
    },
